**Step 1 – Find the nearest airports**

```json
{
  "name": "get_nearest_airport_by_city",
  "arguments": {"location": "Rivermist"}
}
```

```json
{
  "name": "get_nearest_airport_by_city",
  "arguments": {"location": "Los Angeles"}
}
```

**Step 2 – Check the flight cost**

```json
{
  "name": "get_flight_cost",
  "arguments": {
    "travel_from": "<Rivermist Airport Code>",
    "travel_to": "<Los Angeles Airport Code>",
    "travel_date": "2024-11-10",
    "travel_class": "business"
  }
}
```

**Step 3 – Book the flight (if cost ≤ $1200)**

```json
{
  "name": "book_flight",
  "arguments": {
    "access_token": "2278-9812-3456-4567",
    "card_id": "card_6789",
    "travel_date": "2024-11-10",
    "travel_from": "<Rivermist Airport Code>",
    "travel_to": "<Los Angeles Airport Code>",
    "travel_class": "business"
  }
}
```

**Step 4 – Retrieve booking history (to obtain the invoice)**

```json
{
  "name": "get_booking_history",
  "arguments": {"access_token": "2278-9812-3456-4567"}
}
```

These calls will confirm the flight cost, book the flight if it meets your budget constraint, and retrieve the booking details—including the invoice—for your reimbursement.
